hamin: …It smells right.
hamin: I didn't think it would smell right.
> He looks up the beach, towards the seawall, where a vending machine hums in a square of white light.
hamin: The machine was further left.
@sfx glitch
> The vending machine slides one metre to the left, with the faint air of something that has been corrected before and didn't enjoy it.
@textbox echo
echo: Correction noted.
@textbox normal
hamin[smile]: Thank you.
@if rooms() == 0
