> He lets the recording run to the end anyway. Four minutes. Twelve seconds.
@textbox normal
@fx memory n=0.3
@show hamin surprised at=c
@cam closeup hamin
> Hamin hasn't moved. He is looking at the place in the sand where the light was sitting.
@if var.drink == "peach"
